  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\r\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/latest/client-server-api/#deriving-keys-from-passphrases\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe spec text doesn't seem to say anything about the encoding of the passphrase - most clients that support SSSS passphrases likely accept UTF-8 but it's worth being specific about this.\r\n",
